<title>USA: Comtrex Systems hires financial advisor.</title>
<headline>Comtrex Systems hires financial advisor.</headline>
<dateline>MORRESTOWN, N.J. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comtrex Systems Corp said on Wednesday that it had retained financial advisor Dominion Group Ltd &quot;to assist in developing strategic alternatives aimed at enhancing shareholder value.&quot;</p>
<p>Comtrex, a software developer and manufacturer, also posted fourth quarter earnings of $80,521, or $0.03 a share, compared with a loss of 58,180, or $0.02 a share, in the year-ago period.</p>
</text>
